<title>USA: Union Pacific Resources files 3 legal suits.</title>
<headline>Union Pacific Resources files 3 legal suits.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Pacific Resources Group Inc said it filed legal suits on Monday in three jurisdictions in connection with its unsolicited offer to acquire Pennzoil Co through a two-step transaction which currently includes paying $84 per Pennzoil share for 50.1 percent of the company and a tax free exchange of shares for the remaining 49.9 percent.</p>
<p>In Delaware Chancery Court, Union Pacific Resources is seeking a judgment directing Pennzoil's Board to lift the company's anti-takeover defenses.</p>
